# Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and fill in the real values there.
# ".env" itself is gitignored - never commit real credentials.
#
# Email notification feature (dashboard's "Email me when this run finishes"
# checkbox) sends via personal Gmail -> company email. Sending FROM the
# company account was tried and confirmed blocked by org IT policy (no App
# Passwords option exists for it) - see project_context.md's "Dashboard
# feature: email notification on run completion" section for the full story.

# Personal Gmail (sender). Requires 2-Step Verification turned on, then
# generate an "App Password" at https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords -
# use that 16-character code here, NOT your real Gmail password.
PERSONAL_GMAIL_ADDRESS=your.name@gmail.com
PERSONAL_GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password

# Company email (recipient) - no password needed, receiving requires no auth.
COMPANY_EMAIL_ADDRESS=your.name@mankindpharma.com
